# Build-time API base for the REST client (src/lib/apiClient.ts). Empty/unset
# means same-origin requests, fine for local `vite dev` against a proxy but
# wrong for the real Cloudflare Pages build, which needs the tunnel's public
# hostname (plan v2 §2/§6 -- set once P2's named tunnel exists).
VITE_API_BASE=https://tma.<домен>
